  "dcterms:title": "STITCH: Search Tool for Interacting Chemicals",
  "dcterms:description": "STITCH is a database of known and predicted interactions between chemicals and proteins, integrating evidence from experiments, other databases, text-mining, and computational prediction. It covers over 430,000 chemicals and 9.6 million proteins across 2,031 organisms. This brick downloads the STITCH v5.0 .tsv.gz distribution files (chemicals, aliases, sources, inchikeys, chemical-chemical and protein-chemical links, actions) from http://stitch.embl.de/download and converts them to parquet.",
  "dcterms:license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
