      "source": "https://string-db.org/cgi/access (STRING, STITCH's sister database from the same EMBL Bork lab, same distribution terms)",
      "quote": "All data and download files in STRING are freely available under a 'Creative Commons BY 4.0' license.",
      "confidence": "medium"
    }
  ],
  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by BioBricks annotation agent (Claude). Download stage pulls STITCH v5.0 files from stitch.embl.de. The STITCH access/licensing page could not be fetched directly (the server's TLS certificate does not cover stitch.embl.de). STITCH is the chemical companion of STRING, produced by the same group (EMBL/Bork lab, SIB) and distributed under identical terms; STRING's access page explicitly states CC BY 4.0. STITCH's own access page historically states the same. Class attribution, commercial use conditional on attribution. HUMAN MUST verify STITCH's current license statement directly at http://stitch.embl.de/cgi/access.pl once the certificate issue is resolved.",
  "dcterms:creator": "Kuhn M, Szklarczyk D, von Mering C, Bork P, et al. (EMBL / SIB)",
  "dcterms:publisher": "STITCH Consortium (EMBL)",
